# Indexed mutation through a const array rejected

Verifies an indexed assignment through a `const` array binding is rejected as
a write to an immutable binding.

>>> source
const values: int[] = [1]
values[0] = 2

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: cannot assign through immutable binding `values` at Span { start: 26, end: 39 }

<<< exit
1
